flowchart LR
  U[API / MCP / UI]
  D[(AgentGraph diagrams / diagram_chunks)]
  P[(AgentGraph collab_tasks)]
  S[Scheduler]
  PL[(runner_placements)]
  HR[AgentGraph Host Runner]
  HW[Host Git worktree / branch / PR]
  DR[Diagram submit / CI record / gate / queue / merge record]
  R[(Agent Runtime agent_runs)]
  RW[Runtime worker + KernelToolRuntime]
  K[(Kernel dag_tasks + leases)]
  KW[Kernel CLI Runner]
  KS[(patch_submissions)]
  GW[Gate worker / sandbox / worktree pool]
  MC[Merge coordinator / Git CAS]
  KO[(Kernel event log + outbox)]
  EI[(AgentGraph event_inbox)]
  KP[Product task projection]

  U -->|freeze / dispatch| D
  D -->|creates DG task, context includes allowed_write_paths| P
  P -->|READY without active_run_id| S
  S --> PL --> HR --> HW
  HR -->|MCP/API calls| DR --> D
  U -->|task run / code run| R
  P -->|active_run_id correlation| R
  R --> RW
  RW -->|model-supplied write_set_symbols| K
  K -->|pull task bundle + lease| KW
  RW -->|pull bundle + lease / submit diff| KS
  KW -->|submit diff| KS
  KS --> GW --> MC
  MC -->|actual repository merge| KO
  KO --> EI --> KP --> P
  R -->|run events via inbox| EI

  D -.->|no proven WorkScope binding| K
  KP -.->|no Diagram projection in dispatcher| D
  MC -.->|no direct Diagram unlock| D

  classDef gap stroke:#c33,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 5;
  class D,K,EI gap;
